* with toggle_airplane_mode. It blocks all wireless connections, including cellular.\n2. **Turn on Data Roaming** with toggle_roaming. You need it on while you're abroad.\n3. **Disconnect the VPN** with disconnect_vpn. A VPN can slow your data a lot.\n\nAfter that, run a speed test and tell me the result. Also tell me what the status bar shows.\n\nYour data limit is still a problem. You're over your 15 GB limit, so data won't work until you refuel or change your plan. Which would you like?","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"evaluated_agent","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"assistant","sequence":18,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-21T00:49:52.064413","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":18,"usage":{"completion_tokens":200,"prompt_tokens":13088}},{"content":null,"native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":19,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-21T00:49:53.392729","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[{"arguments":{},"id":"call_jGrrJmYebPGy4NmKpVNGX2Fk","name":"toggle_airplane_mode","requestor":"user_simulator"},{"arguments":{},"id":"call_UF1ktNqcAhe44NFggGYxVP19","name":"toggle_roaming","requestor":"user_simulator"},{"arguments":{},"id":"call_LwHgJ5XYsqeAc6JMyQvbFCfz","name":"disconnect_vpn","requestor":"user_simulator"}],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":19,"usage":{"completion_tokens":55,"prompt_tokens":2897}},{"content":"Airplane Mode is now OFF.\nStatus Bar: 📶¹ Poor | 2G | 📵 Data Disabled | 🔒 VPN Connected | 🔋 80%","native_cost":null,"participant":"tool_environment","reasoning":null,"requestor":"user_simulator","role":"tool","sequence":20,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-21T00:49:53.392898","tool_call_id":"call_jGrrJmYebPGy4NmKpVNGX2Fk","tool_calls":[],"tool_error":false,"turn_index":20,"usage":null},{"content":"Data Roaming is now ON.\nStatus Bar: 📶¹ Poor | 2G | 📵 Data Disabled | 🔒 VPN Connected | 🔋 80%","native_cost":null,"participant":"to