index":29,"usage":{"completion_tokens":49,"prompt_tokens":3320}},{"content":"Refueling 2 GB on your Premium Plan costs $2.00 per GB, so the total is **$4.00**, added to your bill. Your usage is over the limit, so data won't work until you refuel or change your plan. Do you confirm you want me to refuel 2 GB on line 555-123-2002? Please reply yes or no.\n\nWhile you decide, please also do these on your phone:\n\n1. **Data Saver:** Turn it off with toggle_data_saver_mode.\n2. **Network mode:** Run check_network_mode_preference and tell me what it shows. If it says 2G or 3G, use set_network_mode_preference with \"4g_5g_preferred\". The 2G you're seeing limits your speed.\n3. **APN settings:** You set the APN to \"internet\", so please run check_apn_settings and tell me what it shows. If it shows \"Incorrect\", use reset_apn_settings and then reboot_device.\n\nPlease also confirm that Airplane Mode is off, Data Roaming is on, and the VPN is disconnected. You didn't mention those in your last message.","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"evaluated_agent","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"assistant","sequence":30,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-21T00:50:04.556191","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":30,"usage":{"completion_tokens":608,"prompt_tokens":13351}},{"content":"Yes, please go ahead and refuel 2 GB on my line.\n\nNow I will follow your instructions on my phone step by step.","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":31,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-21T00:50:06.707317","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[{"arguments":{},"id":"call_PzoQ0n1klFv1z4Ijh3xURbnP","name":"toggle_data_saver_mode","requestor":"user_simulator"},{"arguments":{},"id":"call_wZJU1G6VNtuzp0Cl0qUOefkf","name":"check_network_mode_preference","requestor":"user_simulator"},{"arguments":{},"id":"call_jbO20jvXgGXQ2JdxvuzACkEt","name":"check_apn_settings","requestor":"user_simulat